_ do accumulator-level U32
    - name String

` The list the pattern being emitted keeps for a name it accumulates, or none.
. level = U32.max
for capture in stream-captures
    if capture.accumulates && tree.identifier-name(capture.site)!.text == name
        level = capture.levels
= level

