+ do borrow-levels [LevelMark]
    - id SyntaxId
    - mappings RowRange'SyntaxId

` Lends a rule a call runs the lists of the caller's names its collectors map, each to the
` rule's name it is given for, and keeps how many items each holds as the rule begins.
. marks [LevelMark]
for mapping in tree.children[mappings]
    do match? tree.nodes[mapping]
        | .node-stream-collector-mapping(row)
            . callee = if row.callee then row.callee.text else row.caller.text
            . level = accumulator-level(row.caller.text)
            if level == U32.max
                refuse(.refused-expression, mapping)
                = marks
            borrows += Borrow(callee, level)
            . mark = ir.add-local(u64-layout)
            store-local(mark, load-local(capture-levels[level].size, id), id)
            marks += LevelMark(level, mark)
= marks

