_ do adapt-arms Bool
    - run StreamRun
    - site SyntaxId
    - result TypeId
    - end LocalId
    - joined IRBlockId
    - slot Operand
    - failed IRBlockId

` In place of the arms of a pattern, one call of the function a local rule's arms run in, from
` where the pattern starts: where it passed it gives what it gave and ends where it ended,
` and where not the pattern fails.
